s=s.replace('<p class="intro-description">','<p class="intro-description">Your first ranger shift starts with a guided task.<br>')
s=s.replace('</div><p class="intro-links">','</div><p class="intro-links">Menu / Dispatch: lessons, roundups, boat races, rooftop archives.<br>')
s=s.replace('Build: Spectacle &amp; Trade, September 11, 2026.','Build: Ranch &amp; Coast, September 11, 2026.')
s=s.replace('<div class="control-copy">','<div class="control-copy"><p><b>Ranch and Coast.</b> Menu / Dispatch introduces every new activity. The horn reaches 42 m and shows orange waves. Water reaches 38 m. The zapper reaches 32 m and can arc to nearby animals. Tool halos show a successful hit. All tools are nonlethal.</p><p><b>New destinations.</b> The wetland channel leads west to the coastal boat circuit. Follow 24 ordered buoys for a full lap. Three large buildings have landable roofs; land before exiting with Y. The maintenance lifts connect rooftops, mezzanine galleries and ground-floor archives. Narrow entrances require exploring on foot.</p>')
p.write_text(s)
